        {
          "text": "Naku, mũthũku, ũla ũkũnangĩtwe kũvikĩa kĩkw’ũ, mũnene wĩ mbee ũsumbĩnĩ wa Isilaeli, ũla mũthenya waku nĩ mũku, ĩvinda ya ũthũku wa mũminũkĩlyo, ",
