          "text": "yĩla mekwona mawoni ma ũvũngũ ũndũ waku, yĩla meũkũathĩa movũngũ, makwie ngingonĩ sya athũku ala makũnangĩtwe kũvikĩa kĩkw’ũ, ala mũthenya woo nĩ mũku ĩvinda ya ũthũku wa mũminũkĩlyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
